OL,3,GNEWSAAnger as bridge closure hits
OL,4,Acommunities across two counties
OL,5,
OL,6,FA manufacturer facing an extra #500,000
OL,7,Fa year in costs is among those counting
OL,8,Fthe effects of the closure of a bridge
OL,9,Flinking Cheshire and Shropshire.
OL,11,FA primary school, Christmas tree
OL,12,Fbusiness and pub are also among those
OL,13,Faffected as the A530 at Baddington Lane
OL,14,Fremains closed for the "foreseeable
OL,15,Ffuture".
