OL,3,GNEWSAAnger as bridge closure hits
OL,4,Acommunities across two counties
OL,5,
OL,6,FBusinesses and residents have
OL,7,Fcriticised Cheshire East Council,
OL,8,Farguing the problems at the bridge
OL,9,Fshould have been addressed sooner,
OL,10,Fwhile the authority says public safety
OL,11,Fmust come first and it is working on a
OL,12,Flong-term solution.
OL,14,F"To let it get to the point where it is
OL,15,Funusable I think is ridiculous,
OL,16,Ffrankly," said Edward Lea, whose animal
OL,17,Ffeed company estimates the closure is
OL,18,Fadding about half-a-million pounds a
OL,19,Fyear in fuel and driver costs.
